    "detailed_description": "<i>FirefighterConnon</i> is a linear short narrative visual novel inspired by the TV series <i>&quot;Weird City&quot; (Ep1. &quot;The One&quot;)</i>. <br>The story takes place in a modern world where humans and beast-people coexist. Players will take on the role of the human protagonist, Luo Geng, who has reached the legal marriageable age of 22. Unexpectedly, he forms a marital relationship with a beast-person firefighter named Connor.<br>The free demo version is now available on Steam, which includes two chapters of the game for free!<br><br>FirefighterConnor Discord Channel: <br><br>The full version contains ten chapters, including 22 CGs (with variations), 18 original music tracks, 114,000+ words of dialogue script, and 94 chibi-style character expressions (with variations). The estimated playtime is 2 hours.<br>Feel free to add the game to your wishlist to stay up-to-date with the latest developments!<br><br>Main Character Introduction:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384920/extras/0c02d84b2050abbf45358b50ba42d47b.avif?t=1714467615\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384920/extras/72cc672e95b72f5178b858b9f3d032e3.avif?t=1714467615\" /></span>",
